    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3794933963,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-88faac11dac2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2237.6204263988134,
      "y": -908.8657275395003,
      "strokeColor": "#1E40AF",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 386.40000000000003,
      "height": 175.0,
      "seed": 441999,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Partition\nA partition is one ordered, append-only shard\nof a topic. Every record is written to one\npartition and receives a sequential offset\nthere; multiple partitions distribute storage\nand work across brokers, but ordering is\nguaranteed only within a partition. When a key\nis present, the producer normally hashes its\nserialized bytes so the same key goes to the\nsame partition.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-88faac11dac2",
      "originalText": "Partition\nA partition is one ordered, append-only shard of a topic. Every record is written to one partition and receives a sequential offset there; multiple partitions distribute storage and work across brokers, but ordering is guaranteed only within a partition. When a key is present, the producer normally hashes its serialized bytes so the same key goes to the same partition.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "partition"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8188933237,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-31e69adfb28b",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
