      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Managed Kafka Service\nA hosted offering that exposes Kafka-compatible cluster endpoints while the provider\noperates the underlying service. Providers commonly handle compute, storage,\nnetworking, broker and controller provisioning, security, monitoring, failed-node\nreplacement, patches, upgrades, scaling, partition rebalancing, and high availability.\nYou still design topics, keys, partitions, retention, schemas, producers, consumers, and\nbusiness processing; depending on the offering, the data plane may be open-source\nApache Kafka or a compatible managed engine.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b875d88818ba",
      "originalText": "Managed Kafka Service\nA hosted offering that exposes Kafka-compatible cluster endpoints while the provider operates the underlying service. Providers commonly handle compute, storage, networking, broker and controller provisioning, security, monitoring, failed-node replacement, patches, upgrades, scaling, partition rebalancing, and high availability. You still design topics, keys, partitions, retention, schemas, producers, consumers, and business processing; depending on the offering, the data plane may be open-source Apache Kafka or a compatible managed engine.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "managed-kafka-service"
      }
    },
