      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Davra\nA full industrial IoT platform that bundles\nand manages Kafka alongside device\nintegration, databases, analytics, digital\ntwins, and application services. Kafka acts as\nDavra's internal enterprise message bus and\nIoT data stream, so Davra is broader than a\nstandalone managed Kafka service.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b743f415fbdc",
      "originalText": "Davra\nA full industrial IoT platform that bundles and manages Kafka alongside device integration, databases, analytics, digital twins, and application services. Kafka acts as Davra's internal enterprise message bus and IoT data stream, so Davra is broader than a standalone managed Kafka service.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "davra"
      }
