      "text": "Google Cloud Managed Kafka\nGoogle Cloud's managed service for open-source Apache Kafka. It\nautomates broker provisioning, sizing, storage, partition rebalancing,\ninfrastructure maintenance, security integration, monitoring, and\nlogging.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-a0e57ff6b8ae",
      "originalText": "Google Cloud Managed Kafka\nGoogle Cloud's managed service for open-source Apache Kafka. It automates broker provisioning, sizing, storage, partition rebalancing, infrastructure maintenance, security integration, monitoring, and logging.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "google-managed-kafka"
      }
