    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3253850441,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-8a87c25e1377",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 958.1599037006481,
      "y": 669.0258987236717,
      "strokeColor": "#1E40AF",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 478.3999938964844,
      "height": 105.0,
      "seed": 239302,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bootstrap & Metadata\nThe client starts with one or more bootstrap addresses such as `kafka-\n1.example.com:9092`. It resolves a hostname to an IP address, opens a TCP\nconnection, and requests cluster metadata to learn which brokers exist and\nwhich broker leads each topic partition; the bootstrap broker is an entry point,\nnot a permanent proxy.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-8a87c25e1377",
      "originalText": "Bootstrap & Metadata\nThe client starts with one or more bootstrap addresses such as `kafka-1.example.com:9092`. It resolves a hostname to an IP address, opens a TCP connection, and requests cluster metadata to learn which brokers exist and which broker leads each topic partition; the bootstrap broker is an entry point, not a permanent proxy.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "producer-bootstrap-metadata"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5132571445,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-03eab94f3bea",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
