    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 5427714409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-1b6dc605d594",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2736.3141790395125,
      "y": 698.2170301729545,
      "strokeColor": "#1F2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 401.0333251953125,
      "height": 81.25,
      "seed": 903094,
      "groupIds": [
        "1cnb5uv1"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Edge Device Collects\nThe edge device is a local computing device\u2014such as an industrial\nPC, PLC, embedded controller, or gateway appliance\u2014that receives\nstreams from multiple sensors. It may filter, normalize, batch,\naggregate, or temporarily buffer readings before they move upstream.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-1b6dc605d594",
      "originalText": "Edge Device Collects\nThe edge device is a local computing device\u2014such as an industrial PC, PLC, embedded controller, or gateway appliance\u2014that receives streams from multiple sensors. It may filter, normalize, batch, aggregate, or temporarily buffer readings before they move upstream.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "edge-device-collects"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
