    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3925090354,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-e086f24322eb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 2770.7312155593045,
      "y": 1097.828198743497,
      "strokeColor": "#1F2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 405.59999999999997,
      "height": 146.25,
      "seed": 238618,
      "groupIds": [
        "1cnb5uv1"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client Serializes & Sends\nThe client serializes the key and value into bytes,\nchooses a partition\u2014normally using the key\u2014and finds\nits leader through cluster metadata. It reuses a\npersistent TCP connection, or opens one when needed,\nand sends a binary Kafka produce request; DNS, IP\nrouting, optional TLS and authentication, packet\ntransport, retries, and acknowledgements are handled\nunderneath.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16.25,
      "containerId": "node-e086f24322eb",
      "originalText": "Client Serializes & Sends\nThe client serializes the key and value into bytes, chooses a partition\u2014normally using the key\u2014and finds its leader through cluster metadata. It reuses a persistent TCP connection, or opens one when needed, and sends a binary Kafka produce request; DNS, IP routing, optional TLS and authentication, packet transport, retries, and acknowledgements are handled underneath.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "client-serializes-sends"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
